  "title_zh": "习近平抵达开罗对埃及进行国事访问",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Arrives in Cairo for State Visit to Egypt",
  "summary_zh": "当地时间9月1日晚，国家主席习近平乘专机抵达开罗，应埃及总统塞西邀请对埃及进行国事访问，塞西总统夫妇到场迎接。",
  "summary_en": "On the evening of September 1 local time, President Xi Jinping arrived in Cairo by special plane for a state visit to Egypt at the invitation of Egyptian President Abdel Fattah el-Sisi, who welcomed him at the airport with his wife.",
